    "body": "$\\left(x+\\frac1x\\right)^3=x^3+\\frac1{x^3}+3\\left(x+\\frac1x\\right)$, so $x^3+\\frac1{x^3}=64-12=52$.\n\n**Answer: (B) 52**"
