    "title": "Sums of rows",
    "body": "The last numbers of the rows are $1,5,11,19,\\dots$, which are $n^2+n-1$: indeed row $n$ ends at the $\\frac{n(n+1)}2$-th odd number, $2\\cdot\\frac{n(n+1)}2-1=n^2+n-1$. For $n=80$: $6400+80-1=6479$.\n\n**Answer: (A) 6479**"
